 FLCN/SMCR8-type"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":537,"end":537,"description":"Phosphoserine; by ULK1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":542,"end":542,"description":"Phosphoserine; by ULK1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":571,"end":571,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{"FNIP2":[1,2,3,4,13,14,15,17,24,25,26,27,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,101,102,104,106,107,109,114,115,116,117,118,120,122,123,127,130,131,132,133,134,135,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,154,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,183,184,186,187,192,194,199,206,252,253,255,256,257,259,260,263,264,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,282,283,286,287,485,488,489,492,494,495,496,498,499,502,503,505,506,507,509,510,511,513,516,517,520,521,525,527,531,534,535,538,558,560,561,564,565]},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts (via C-terminus) with FNIP1 or FNIP2 (via C-terminus) (PubMed:17028174, PubMed:18403135, PubMed:18663353, PubMed:27353360, PubMed:36103527). Component of the lysosomal folliculin complex (LFC), composed of FLCN, FNIP1 (or FNIP2), RagA/RRAGA or RagB/RRAGB GDP-bound, RagC/RRAGC or RagD/RRAGD GTP-bound, and Ragulator (PubMed:31672913, PubMed:31704029, PubMed:36103527). Interaction with FNIP1 or FNIP2 mediates indirect interaction with the PRKAA1, PRKAB1 and PRKAG1 subunits of 5'-AMP-activated protein kinase (AMPK) (PubMed:17028174). Interacts with HSP90AA1 in the presence of FNIP1 (PubMed:27353360). Interacts with HSP70, STUB1, CDC37, AHSA1, CCT2, STIP1, PTGES3 and PPP5C (PubMed:27353360). Interacts with GABARAP; interaction takes place in the presence of FNIP1 and/or FNIP2 (PubMed:25126726). Interaction with GABARAP sequesters FLCN, thereby inactivating mTORC1 (PubMed:34597140). Interacts with RILP; the interaction is direct and promotes association between RILP and RAB34 (PubMed:27113757). Interacts with KIF3A and KIF3B (PubMed:27072130). Interacts with lactate dehydrogenase LDHA, but not LDHB; the interaction is direct, may preferentially 